{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And the Levites shall be Mine, I am YHWH.</b> The intention of the statement <b>I am YHWH</b> is to say that even though our Sages of blessed memory said (Yalkut Shimoni 564) that in the future the service will return to the firstborn, the Levites will not descend from belonging to HaShem. And this is what it means by <b>And they shall be Mine, I am YHWH</b> — just as My name is forever and ever, so too the Levites shall be Mine."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:05:55.846252420Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}